      "private": false,
      "reactions": null,
      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "We've been investigating this for a bit, and we believe that it has something to do with networking in general, not a specific networked component.\n\nWe've been making changes over the past week that should help with reducing this. Local network problems (where local is anywhere between you and your ISP's connection out to the internet) won't be improved by this work, but we've been monitoring our network's general status to see how this is improving.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
