      "statusChangeID": "5d575c3121b8093b20a1d2c5",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "complete",
      "value": "We're not seeing this nearly as often anymore. Our providers are continuing to look into this and we're helping out, but I'm going to mark this as complete for now. \n\nThat being said, you might still rarely run into it-- but rest assured we're still working on this issue. Its just hard to call network issues \"completed\", as they'll always exist in some form! :P",
